Objective

Implement metadata-aware retrieval filters across retrieval, API, CLI, evaluation, and demo surfaces where appropriate.

The goal is to allow retrieval to constrain candidate chunks/documents using document metadata before or during ranking.

Example use cases:

Only retrieve from jurisdiction = eu.
Only retrieve from jurisdiction = es.
Only retrieve from corpus_name = legalize_sample.
Only retrieve from legal_document_type = regulation.
Only retrieve from language = en.

This phase must remain local-first and deterministic.

