## Design decision to keep explicit

Use **exact-match JSONB filters** only.

Do not implement this yet:

```text
jurisdiction IN [...]
date ranges
effective_date <= X
language fallback
metadata boosting
query DSL
facets
hybrid filtering + boosting

Those can come later.

For now, the clean contract is:

metadata_filter fields are ANDed exact matches over document metadata.

That is enough to make the engine meaningfully better without destabilizing it.